msgstr "UFFDIO_WAKE"

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"(Since Linux 4.3.)  Wake up the thread waiting for page-fault resolution on "
"a specified memory address range."
msgstr ""
