#: mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"If this feature bit is set, userfaultfd supports write-protect faults for "
"anonymous memory.  (Note that shmem / hugetlbfs support is indicated by a "
"separate feature.)"
msgstr ""

#. type: TP
#: mageia-cauldron
